Household objects modelled for a RepRap printer. The two vase-mode lampshades,
the fluted bookend, the self-watering planter and the little geometry helper
library they use plus the upstream LICENSE are vendored verbatim from the
pinned commit. The bookend and the planter include the author's lumpyscad
helper library, which is vendored separately; the rest of this collection is
not vendored.

